activity Define Project Scope
activity Develop Frontend Interface
activity Design Database Schema
activity Implement Backend Logic
activity Integrate Payment Gateway
activity Test System Functionality
activity Deploy Application to Server
activity Monitor System Performance
activity Gather User Feedback
activity Update System Based on Feedback
bind Define Project Scope: Project Status, Development Time
bind Implement Backend Logic: Payment Method, Number of Users
bind Test System Functionality: Transaction Volume, Number of Users
bind Deploy Application to Server: Deployment Environment, Number of Bugs
bind Gather User Feedback: User Satisfaction, Feedback Type
Project Status: On Track, Delayed
Development Time: integer between 0 and 10000
Budget Allocated: float between 0 and 100000000
Payment Method: Credit Card, PayPal, Bank Transfer, Cryptocurrency
Number of Users: integer between 0 and 1000000
Transaction Volume: integer between 0 and 1000000000
Deployment Environment: Development, Staging, Production, Testing
Number of Bugs: integer between 0 and 10000
User Satisfaction: float between 1.0 and 5.0
Feedback Type: Bug Report, Feature Request, General Feedback, Complaint
Init[Define Project Scope] | |
Precedence[Design Database Schema, Develop Frontend Interface] | | |
Response[Implement Backend Logic, Integrate Payment Gateway] | | |
Co-Existence[Test System Functionality, Deploy Application to Server] | | |
Chain Succession[Deploy Application to Server, Monitor System Performance] | | |
Not Precedence[Define Project Scope, Gather User Feedback] | | |
Not Response[Define Project Scope, Update System Based on Feedback] | | |
Exclusive Choice[Design Database Schema, Develop Frontend Interface] | | |
Existence[Update System Based on Feedback] | |
Absence6[Test System Functionality] | |
Response[Define Project Scope, Design Database Schema] |A.Project Status is Delayed AND A.Development Time > 1000 | |
Response[Implement Backend Logic, Integrate Payment Gateway] |A.Payment Method is Credit Card AND A.Number of Users > 1000 | |0,60,m
Response[Deploy Application to Server, Monitor System Performance] |A.Deployment Environment is Production AND A.Number of Bugs < 10 | |0,24,h
Response[Gather User Feedback, Update System Based on Feedback] |A.User Satisfaction < 3.0 AND A.Feedback Type is Bug Report | |0,1,d
Response[Test System Functionality, Integrate Payment Gateway] |A.Transaction Volume > 1000000 AND A.Number of Users > 10000 | |0,7,d